CachedThreadPool:
----------------

1. This is will dynamically will generate the threads as per the threads. and removes the idle thread from the thread pool.
2. Use when load variable and short live tasks.
3. Dont use cachedthreadpool for long tasks which consumes all your system resources and may create out of memory exception due to threads 



 

